+	// SearchCapabilities reports how this reader's search methods (FindTraces,
+	// FindTraceIDs and FindTraceSummaries) behave where backends differ.
+	//
+	// A reader whose backend cannot be asked (e.g. it sits behind an API with no
+	// capability discovery) returns an error that wraps errors.ErrUnsupported
+	// rather than a value the caller might trust. The context is honored because
+	// the answer may come over the network.
+	//
+	// A Reader that wraps another Reader (decorators, interceptors) MUST forward
+	// this call to the wrapped Reader rather than answer for itself; otherwise
+	// capabilities of the underlying backend are hidden from every caller.
+	SearchCapabilities(ctx context.Context) (SearchCapabilities, error)
 }
